          "filename": "Peel Railway Station (geograph 2111841).jpg",
          "caption": "Peel Railway StationSituated in Station Road, this station was at the western end of the three foot gauge Isle of Man Railway line from Douglas to Peel. It closed on the 7th September, 1968 and this photo was taken almost two years later. Industrial premises now occupy this site, although the line itself is now a Manx heritage trail.",
